{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11111380","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11111380","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1111138001:0":{"text":"시간이 참 빠르군. 여러분, 이제 헤어질 시간이 왔네.","source_cn":"时间总是转瞬即逝，各位，该说再见了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3142A1AB6A446BA3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"시간이 참 빠르군. 여러분, 이제 헤어질 시간이 왔네.","female":"시간이 참 빠르군. 여러분, 이제 헤어질 시간이 왔네.","variant_male_record_index":"121972","variant_female_record_index":"121973","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111138002:0":{"text":"떠나시려고요? 크림슨 고원으로 같이 안 가세요?","source_cn":"你要走了？不一起去深红高原吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23B40CC88771AFBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111138003:1":{"text":"보물찾기는 젊은이들의 로망이지. 아저씨가 낄 데가 아니야.","source_cn":"寻宝是年轻人的浪漫，大叔就不参与了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44B147770049FFAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111138004:1":{"text":"그리고... 마지막으로 조언 하나 하지. 크림슨 고원은 정말 위험해. 다들 각자의 실력에 자신이 있다고 해도 경계를 늦추지 않는 게 좋아.","source_cn":"另外……算是我最后的忠告吧：深红高原危机四伏，就算你们...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE627CF47089383FA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그리고... 마지막으로 조언 하나 하지. 크림슨 고원은 정말 위험해. 다들 각자의 실력에 자신이 있다고 해도 경계를 늦추지 않는 게 좋아.","female":"그리고... 마지막으로 조언 하나 하지. 크림슨 고원은 정말 위험해. 다들 각자의 실력에 자신이 있다고 해도 경계를 늦추지 않는 게 좋아.","variant_male_record_index":"121976","variant_female_record_index":"121977","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111138005:0":{"text":"걱정하지 마. 할 수 있어.","source_cn":"放心，我们搞得定。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6076177C0A649AE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111138006:1":{"text":"그 거만한 입버릇은 고쳐지질 않는군.","source_cn":"口气还是这么狂妄啊，小兄弟。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A93D5B02774E0E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111138007:0":{"text":"새삼스럽게 뭘 또 그러세요.","source_cn":"你也不是第一天认识他了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AFC523F9C021AC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111138008:0":{"text":"그래, 너희도 할 일이 많을 테니, 더는 붙잡고 있지 않을게.","source_cn":"好吧，你们还有事要忙，我就不留你们了。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4BFA09CC17EE30F0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그래, 너희도 할 일이 많을 테니, 더는 붙잡고 있지 않을게.","female":"그래, 너희도 할 일이 많을 테니, 더는 붙잡고 있지 않을게.","variant_male_record_index":"121981","variant_female_record_index":"121982","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1111138009:0":{"text":"너희의 흥미진진한 모험담이 듣고 싶으니까, 크림슨 고원에서 돌아오면 언제 한번 모이자고.","source_cn":"等你们从深红高原回来，我们找个地方聚一聚，我很乐意听你...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x64DC1615A9C220DB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"너희의 흥미진진한 모험담이 듣고 싶으니까, 크림슨 고원에서 돌아오면 언제 한번 모이자고.","female":"너희의 흥미진진한 모험담이 듣고 싶으니까, 크림슨 고원에서 돌아오면 언제 한번 모이자고.","variant_male_record_index":"121983","variant_female_record_index":"121984","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1111138010:0":{"text":"당신이 쏘는 건가?","source_cn":"你请客？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x440EC9CF07CC7D1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1111138011:0":{"text":"당연하지! 내가 그렇게 좀생이로 보이나?","source_cn":"当然！我像是那种小气的男人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x73E6139E031CD931","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1111138012:0":{"text":"그리고 이번 복수는 너희가 도와준 셈이니까.","source_cn":"说起来，这次复仇还是你们帮了我一把。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CF05F25F833A9A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1111138013:0":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 도움이 될지도 모르니, 이걸 가져가.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3693FD6E0F818F70","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 도움이 될지도 모르니, 이걸 가져가.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 도움이 될지도 모르니, 이걸 가져가.","variant_male_record_index":"121988","variant_female_record_index":"121989","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1111138013":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 도움이 될지도 모르니, 이걸 가져가.","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name></style>，你拿着这个，或许有点用。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3693FD6E0F818F70","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 도움이 될지도 모르니, 이걸 가져가.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 도움이 될지도 모르니, 이걸 가져가.","variant_male_record_index":"121988","variant_female_record_index":"121989","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1111138014:0":{"text":"뭘, 넌 이걸 가질 자격이 있어.","source_cn":"客气什么，你应得的。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1C04B0BE3A49F0A0","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"뭘, 넌 이걸 가질 자격이 있어.","female":"뭘, 넌 이걸 가질 자격이 있어.","variant_male_record_index":"121990","variant_female_record_index":"121991","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1111138016:0":{"text":"자, 그럼 여기서 헤어지자고. 나 없다고 너무 섭섭해하지 말고.","source_cn":"行啦，就在这里分别吧，你们可不要太想我。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBDAEADE81A72F170","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"자, 그럼 여기서 헤어지자고. 나 없다고 너무 섭섭해하지 말고.","female":"자, 그럼 여기서 헤어지자고. 나 없다고 너무 섭섭해하지 말고.","variant_male_record_index":"121994","variant_female_record_index":"121995","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1111138017:1":{"text":"말이 많네. 갈 거면 얼른 가.","source_cn":"话真多，要走就走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5821D9FD411B6F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1111138018:1":{"text":"하하하하, 역시!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈，不愧是你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C9BC65D4814DF36","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1111138019:1":{"text":"그럼 잘 가시게들!","source_cn":"各位，再见了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x384F6B9CFB2E2DB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1111138020:0":{"text":"... 잘 가.","source_cn":"……再见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA90552F8015A2BC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1111138021:1":{"text":"아휴... 아저씨도 갔으니, 이제 소렌이랑 말다툼 해줄 사람이 없네요.","source_cn":"哎呀……大叔走了，都没人跟索恩抬杠了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2B7EB17261C1BFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:26:1111138021":{"text":"아휴... 아저씨도 갔으니, 이제 소렌이랑 말다툼 해줄 사람이 없네요.","source_cn":"哎呀……大叔走了，都没人跟索恩抬杠了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2B7EB17261C1BFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1111138022:1":{"text":"맞는 말이네요! 가는 동안 분명 떠들썩하겠죠?!","source_cn":"说得对！我想，这一路依旧会很热闹的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74A2D1656185CB80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:26:0:1":{"text":"너도 있잖아?","source_cn":"这不是还有你吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x63A18F1031049B97","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"너도 있잖아?","female":"너도 있잖아?","variant_male_record_index":"63482","variant_female_record_index":"63483","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:0:1":{"text":"고마워","source_cn":"谢谢","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0CBD5AFCD8099572","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"고마워","female":"고마워","variant_male_record_index":"63478","variant_female_record_index":"63479","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1111138015:0":{"text":"현지인한테는 흔한 물건이거든. 넌 기념으로 가져가.","source_cn":"这东西对本地人而言太常见了，还是你留着做个纪念吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9A42CC36663BE7A1","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"현지인한테는 흔한 물건이거든. 넌 기념으로 가져가.","female":"현지인한테는 흔한 물건이거든. 넌 기념으로 가져가.","variant_male_record_index":"121992","variant_female_record_index":"121993","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:1:2":{"text":"나한테만 주는 거야?","source_cn":"只给我一个人？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xED2E1670A3E4E7C4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"나한테만 주는 거야?","female":"나한테만 주는 거야?","variant_male_record_index":"63480","variant_female_record_index":"63481","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:瓦尔克":{"text":"워커","source":"瓦尔克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:萨忒娜":{"text":"사트라나","source":"萨忒娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","sourc